01:33:15,840 --> 01:33:17,920
No two playthroughs of the bunker are the same.

1921
01:33:18,020 --> 01:33:19,980
Items, traps, codes, and more are all randomized.

1922
01:33:20,280 --> 01:33:21,340
No, no, no, no, no, no.

1923
01:33:21,340 --> 01:33:23,820
Two new difficulty modes unlocked?

1924
01:33:24,360 --> 01:33:26,580
Shell shock mode, extreme difficulty?

1925
01:33:28,180 --> 01:33:30,060
I mean, how does the game get more difficult?

1926
01:33:30,280 --> 01:33:33,160
I guess you get one shot by the monster instead of...

1927
01:33:33,160 --> 01:33:34,100
Yeah, I don't know.

1928
01:33:35,800 --> 01:33:37,600
30 plus game changing settings.

1929
01:33:38,860 --> 01:33:39,480
Okay.

1930
01:33:41,480 --> 01:33:43,240
Tweaked stalker behaviors?

1931
01:33:44,090 --> 01:33:45,840
That increases unpredictability.

1932
01:33:46,080 --> 01:33:46,640
Oh no!

1933
01:33:48,300 --> 01:33:50,380
A sub-level fuse system.

1934
01:33:53,330 --> 01:33:54,070
Oh no.

1935
01:33:55,850 --> 01:33:56,770
Absolutely not.

1936
